WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.116
One common misunderstanding:

2
00:00:00.116 --> 00:00:00.451
this rule does not promise that every trade wins or prevent normal ups and downs.

3
00:00:00.451 --> 00:00:00.754
What it guarantees is fairness—you never pay a penny on recovery dollars,

4
00:00:00.754 --> 00:00:01.060
and every exact whole cent is accounted for with nothing lost to rounding.
